      <section class="case-study-section section-pad" id="literev" aria-labelledby="literev-title">
        <div class="container section-grid">
          <div class="section-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow section-label"><span>03 /</span> Literature review</p>
            <h2 id="literev-title">LiteRev</h2>
            <p>A scientific literature review project connected to The GRAPH Network.
              Its University of Geneva founding team includes
              <a href="https://unige.ch/medecine/isg/research/infectious-diseases-and-mathematical-modelling-professor-olivia-keiser/group-members/erol-orel">Erol Orel</a>,
              <a href="https://www.unige.ch/unitec/en/presentation/innogap-proof-of-principle-fund/projetsfinances">Fatma Aziza Merzouki</a>,
              and <a href="https://www.unige.ch/medecine/isg/research/infectious-diseases-and-mathematical-modelling-professor-olivia-keiser/group-members/olivia-keiser">Professor Olivia Keiser</a>.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://literev.unige.ch/">
              More about LiteRev <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p class="about-lead">Research data workflows, search, and software infrastructure.</p>
            <p>
              Contributions included technical leadership, data processing,
              clustering, AI-related work, benchmarking, background tasks with Celery,
              search with Elasticsearch, web development, and DevOps.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
